# Collected community benchmark corpus (IPD 20260722-2209-01, Phase 2 local pull model).
#
# Track ONLY the accepted, redacted results + their metadata sidecars + the README, and the
# regenerated summaries. Every stored result is a `*.redacted.json` that passed schema /5 +
# share-safety validation and the 256 KB store cap; an unmarked or non-redacted file must never
# land here. Anything else (scratch, temp downloads) stays local-only.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!accepted/
accepted/*
!accepted/*.redacted.json
!accepted/*.meta.json
!summary.csv
!summary.md
